      "content": "I'll read the original test file and the CUT to understand the code before improving it.Now I understand the original test. The `test_equals_and_hashCode` method uses `EqualsTester` but everything is crammed on one line. I'll improve readability by:\n1. Breaking the `EqualsTester` chain across multiple lines with clear variable names\n2. Removing the unused data provider methods that clutter this focused test class\n3. Removing unused importsNow I'll compile-check the test.The improved test compiled successfully. The refactored test extracts each `TaiInstant` into a named variable before passing it to `EqualsTester`, making the three equality groups and their intent immediately clear, and removes all the unused data provider methods that were cluttering the original file."
